  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Tai Qiu, a thin Gu Immortal with wrinkled skin stuck to his bones and veins showing everywhere rides a huge wave and blocks a green-grey bird. Surrounding Gu Immortals look wary. After He Ruo activates an Immortal Gu and passes the first waves, he mocks her, raises two water walls, and charges along the currents. She will not fight him and climbs; the waves rise with her, yet she still pulls away for a time.",
      "chapters": [
        782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tai_qiu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_he_ruo",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is so thin his bones can be seen. His skin is wrinkled and dry, sticking close to his bones. Veins show everywhere on his skin.",
      "chapters": [
        782
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Tai Qiu he keeps fighting over Dong Fang Chang Fan’s inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        785
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_dong_fang_chang_fan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He and Unfettered Scholar each fight two desolate level phantom beasts that can stay phantom for a long time, and they cannot finish those beasts quickly. When Lu Qing Ming’s entangled wind is about to land, Pi Shui Han frees himself for a moment and raises a water lotus under the mass; most of the wind blades split, dodge, and reform.",
      "chapters": [
        785
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_unfettered_scholar",
        "char_lu_qing_ming",
        "move_entangled_wind"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He and Unfettered Scholar have old grudges and have fought before, but after seeing Fang Yuan’s strength he sets the grudge aside and turns his firepower on Fang Yuan, who answers with strength path giant hands.",
      "chapters": [
        786
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "move_myriad_self_giant_hand"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the blood veil over the immemorial ruin bat corpse holds, he shouts for space and activates the water path and ice path immortal killer move Flood Glacier, spending rank seven red date immortal essence while over ten thousand Gu worms run in his aperture. Waves roar out within hundreds of steps, freeze from the inside out, and smash down; the glacier deforms the veil but cannot break it.",
      "chapters": [
        790
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tai-qiu-retreat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_flood_glacier",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Old Lord Can Yang then sends life chasing fire through the veil into the iceberg. Pi Shui Han screams as yellow fire covers him; water and ice do not put it out, and healing that raises his life force makes the burn fiercer. He flees Tai Qiu still on fire.",
      "chapters": [
        791
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tai-qiu-retreat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_lord_can_yang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the road he sees that his clothes are unburnt, realizes the fire only burns living force, restrains most of the life force in his body, and extinguishes it. A few rank six demonic path Gu Immortals who have left stealthily try to take advantage of him and are not his match. The fight then draws Qie Shi Min and Half Moon Brutemaster, who talk him into attacking Jade Pool blessed land instead of returning to Tai Qiu.",
      "chapters": [
        795
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tai-qiu-retreat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qie_shi_min",
        "char_half_moon_brutemaster",
        "loc_jade_pool_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the demonic path Gu Immortals looting Jade Pool blessed land, he says he can give up even the wisdom path inheritance; what he wants is Dong Fang Chang Fan’s possession method.",
      "chapters": [
        801
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Dong Fang Chang Fan flees, Pi Shui Han is in the second wave of the chase with Fang Yuan and Qie Shi Min. A starlight ray pierces Qie Shi Min’s forehead and his head explodes. Fang Yuan and Pi Shui Han keep chasing until Dong Fang Chang Fan uses split shadow Immortal Gu, and the two have to split up.",
      "chapters": [
        804
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "jade-pool-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Iron Eagle blessed land he meets Unfettered Scholar over a rank seven immortal material, green jade wind, and asks to fight because Tai Qiu left no victor.",
      "chapters": [
        1105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a brand new immortal killer move, but it cannot compete with Unfettered Scholar’s thousand disintegrations, and he leaves without spending further.",
      "chapters": [
        1106
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_thousand_disintegrations"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He later pounces on Hei Tie Sheng with Flood Glacier; a Hei tribe rank six Gu Immortal names it his signature killer move. Black water covers the white glacier and breaks it in a few breaths, and Pi Shui Han spits blood and falls. Hei Tie Sheng has deep enmity with him and is even stronger. Pi Shui Han then retreats, having obtained some eagle nests and large amounts of rank eight immortal materials.",
      "chapters": [
        1109
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-scramble",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_tie_sheng",
        "fac_hei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From a record of Ye Lui Qun Xing’s earlier battles, Fang Yuan judges him probably at the level of experts like Unfettered Scholar and Pi Shui Han, or maybe slightly weaker.",
      "chapters": [
        1202
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-as-a-benchmark",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_lui_qun_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Central Continent he and Xiao Hu Chi force a guarding Gu Immortal away from a resource point, then fight over the split. Xiao Shi Rang joins Xiao Hu Chi; after a time both Xiao clan Gu Immortals retreat. Xiao Shi Rang names him Northern Plains’ demonic path Gu Immortal Pi Shui Han, and Xiao Hu Chi is completely suppressed by how he fights.",
      "chapters": [
        1705
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "central-continent-raid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_xiao_hu_chi",
        "char_xiao_shi_rang",
        "fac_xiao_clan",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    }
  ],
